    "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>story</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a strange house and look for a way out to escape as quickly as possible. However, you cannot escape from the house because the doors are locked by numerous locks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Still, you try to find a way out of the house and look for something you can use inside. Then, Banshee, a frightening looking fairy, attacked you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you escape from the house of horror by using the items you picked up along the way, while running away from Banshee?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the game</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an exploration type horror game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The objective of the game is to find items while exploring the dimly lit house, and sometimes combine items to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Banshee, a frightening looking fairy, will chase you while you are exploring. If you are caught, you will be beaten and forced to return to your initial location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are caught by \u201cBanshee,\u201d one day will pass, and if you exceed the fifth day, you will be Game Over, so try not to get caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also traps and surprises along the way to lure \u201cBanshee.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music License Notice:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game uses background music from Fesliyan Studios under a commercial license.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your gameplay videos on YouTube receive a copyright claim, you can dispute it using the official Game Release Code below:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Game Release Code:** [CHMBR08062025]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the dispute explanation, please mention:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;This video contains licensed music from Fesliyan Studios used in the game '[Banshee]'. Game Release Code: [CHMBR08062025]&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For any issues, feel free to contact us.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>story</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a strange house and look for a way out to escape as quickly as possible. However, you cannot escape from the house because the doors are locked by numerous locks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Still, you try to find a way out of the house and look for something you can use inside. Then, Banshee, a frightening looking fairy, attacked you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you escape from the house of horror by using the items you picked up along the way, while running away from Banshee?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the game</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an exploration type horror game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The objective of the game is to find items while exploring the dimly lit house, and sometimes combine items to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Banshee, a frightening looking fairy, will chase you while you are exploring. If you are caught, you will be beaten and forced to return to your initial location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are caught by \u201cBanshee,\u201d one day will pass, and if you exceed the fifth day, you will be Game Over, so try not to get caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also traps and surprises along the way to lure \u201cBanshee.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music License Notice:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game uses background music from Fesliyan Studios under a commercial license.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your gameplay videos on YouTube receive a copyright claim, you can dispute it using the official Game Release Code below:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Game Release Code:** [CHMBR08062025]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the dispute explanation, please mention:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;This video contains licensed music from Fesliyan Studios used in the game '[Banshee]'. Game Release Code: [CHMBR08062025]&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For any issues, feel free to contact us.</p>",
